      formula: "Match each observed trait to soil definitions and distribution.",
      substitution: "Strongly leached soils on old Tertiary surfaces in high-rainfall Central Africa are ferralsols; calcium and magnesium are very low.",
      calculation: "Every trait - leaching, low nutrients, red-yellow color, pseudo-sand feel - matches ferralsols, which cover 10% of African soils.",
      answer: "Ferralsols."
